      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.096,
      "atempo": 1.016,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "file": "S03.mp3",
      "text": "前一天深夜，她下班回家，身后多了一个沉默的影子。",
      "sha256": "fc29edb90d67556d69dfa74a6adff180245ae91a3602b820fa0cc656e2e8d2e9",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 12.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.864,
      "atempo": 1.144,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "file": "S04.mp3",
      "text": "现场没有拍到凶手的画面，只留下不属于熟人的生物痕迹。",
      "sha256": "97df528a226dffdea7b0f821bbfa9c70bfa947313c0b1b77165aff6f7b2cd8a1",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 18.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.024,
      "atempo": 1.004,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "file": "S05.mp3",
      "text": "一串数据，把这个案子引向了附近的居民。",
      "sha256": "75a09e69e2e549d110de939fa95d3bc6cd5ce0506d85dbdcff9e4a04ca1f7427",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 24.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.656,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.344
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "file": "S06.mp3",
      "text": "警视厅逐人比对，一千五百份样本被送进实验室。",
      "sha256": "d3f45877c26eb86f3684927232f441e82524e0802f56cb4912ea7b6e4d3a2fdb",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 30.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.208,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.792
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "file": "S07.mp3",
      "text": "符合条件的那个人，就住在离她不远的地方。",
      "sha256": "ca0631c2b1f427fedf4b5c0cf64a314083aca37f07358f0e86a692e2ba82d3e6",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 36.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.824,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.176
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "file": "S08.mp3",
      "text": "他叫户仓高广，案发时刚刚失业，正准备返回福岛。",
      "sha256": "1dc11918aa4b7acc6ab9d69ab86c1df3ad982fc1d48686be8e41edf94db91470",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 42.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.928,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.072
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "file": "S09.mp3",
      "text": "检测结果显示生物痕迹一致。二零一六年三月十二日，他在福岛落网。",
      "sha256": "d1347e50de326c44717d63ca4073f7028db2d8307fab62ead274aa9451d06246",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 48.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 7.488,
      "atempo": 1.248,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "file": "S10.mp3",
      "text": "从那晚算起，追查已经过去了大约两百天。",
      "sha256": "15a878907418b67225829a8034c6922ab7a9d06f156f992c68ff221b00347866",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 54.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.944,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.056
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "file": "S11.mp3",
      "text": "法庭上，他承认杀人，却说只想交换联系方式。",
      "sha256": "dc6cf6447ef948f8be63f29b6f0370aa473f712c676c5bfb9d63190306bb98ab",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 60.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.856,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.144
    },
    {
      "id": "S12",
      "file": "S12.mp3",
      "text": "他后来声称，自己那晚听到了恶魔的声音。",
      "sha256": "0242b5e144807fcf2944c241ca9d2b4849709a15bbc439cec73b5abaa3ed0970",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 66.0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.488,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.512
    },
    {
      "id": "S13",
      "file": "S13.mp3",
      "text": "可案发前，并没有能支持这种说法的鉴定记录。",
      "sha256": "b9b0d2e7ae1e4166e3d0a4517d51ba3b08168e4d676b7fed66d23134eaef1cb7",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑",
